{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google近日宣佈，旗下搜索服務中的AI Mode（AI模式）正式引入一種類似「隱身模式」的全新私隱功能。藉助這一名為「臨時對話線程」的機制，用户與AI進行的對話不會被記錄到搜索歷史中，也不會影響未來的個性化推薦和內容呈現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587000.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T20:44:25.130019+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:23:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_hash":"9119e18f0be5daa0445fbf3c5c7994b65ba29bf8b24ea4af1c00fd144aaff991","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}